🧪 Prompt Engineering Playground

A beginner-friendly Python-based project to experiment with different prompt engineering techniques, generate better prompts, and evaluate AI responses.

📌 About the Project

The Prompt Engineering Playground helps users understand and practice prompt engineering techniques such as Zero-Shot Prompting, Role-Based Prompting, Few-Shot Prompting, and Structured Prompting.

The application allows users to create customized prompts by specifying a task, role, context, target audience, output format, and constraints.

It also provides a checklist to manually evaluate AI-generated responses.

✨ Features

- Generate Zero-Shot prompts
- Create Role-Based prompts
- Generate Few-Shot prompt templates
- Create Structured and Step-by-Step prompts
- Customize prompts using context and instructions
- Download generated prompts as text files
- Evaluate AI responses using a checklist
- Simple and interactive web interface
- No API key required for the current version

