⚙️ Installation and Setup

Step 1: Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/prompt-engineering-playground.git

Replace "YOUR-USERNAME" with your GitHub username.

Step 2: Open the Project Folder

cd prompt-engineering-playground

Step 3: Install Dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

Step 4: Run the Application

streamlit run app.py

The application will open in your web browser.

🧠 Prompt Engineering Techniques

1. Zero-Shot Prompting

Provides instructions to an AI model without giving a specific example.

2. Role-Based Prompting

Assigns a role to the AI, such as teacher, programmer, or career advisor.

3. Few-Shot Prompting

Provides an example to guide the model toward the desired response style.

4. Structured Prompting

Organizes instructions and asks for a clear, structured response.

🚀 How to Use

1. Open the application.
2. Enter your task or question.
3. Specify the AI role and target audience.
4. Add context and constraints if needed.
5. Select the required output format.
6. Compare the generated prompt variations.
7. Download a prompt and test it in an AI model.
8. Paste the model's response into the evaluation section.
9. Use the checklist to review the response.

